      "term": "crouch",
      "start": 2.78,
      "end": 3.68,
      "detail": "From the upright arms-overhead stance held at 2.08-2.58, the athlete flexes knees and hips into a deep squat (visible bend at 2.78, lowest position by ~3.28) and holds the loaded crouch through 3.68; feet stay flat on the track, body oriented to the right. This is the preparatory dip, not a held pose, since it immediately precedes the jump.",
      "attributes": {
        "knee_action": "flex",
        "feet": "both",
        "body_direction": "right"
      },
      "id": "A001",
      "part": "S2_0000_0050"
    },
    {
      "shot": "S2",
      "actor": "athlete",
      "term": "backswing",
      "start": 2.78,
      "end": 3.68,
      "detail": "Simultaneous with the crouch, both arms travel from overhead down and backward, reaching full rear extension behind the hips by 3.18-3.68 (arms trailing low behind the body in the deep squat frames).",
      "attributes": {
        "arm_direction": "backward"
      },
      "id": "A002",
      "part": "S2_0000_0050"
    },
    {
      "shot": "S2",
      "actor": "athlete",
      "term": "forward_swing",
      "start": 3.98,
      "end": 4.58,
      "detail": "Arms reverse from the rear through a low forward position (3.98-4.08), drive up in front of the body at takeoff (4.28), and finish overhead during early flight (4.58), providing the propulsive swing for the standing jump.",
      "attributes": {
        "arm_direction": "forward_up"
      },
      "id": "A003",
      "part": "S2_0000_0050"
    },
    {
      "shot": "S2",
      "actor": "athlete",
      "term": "leg_extension",
      "start": 4.08,
      "end": 4.48,
      "detail": "Push-off from the crouch: at 4.28 the hips/knees are extending with heels lifting off the track, and by ~4.4-4.5 both feet have left the ground (airborne by 4.58). Exact toe-off instant falls between the 4.28 and 4.58 frames, so the end time is approximate.",
      "attributes": {
        "knee_action": "extend",
        "feet": "both"
      },
      "id": "A004",
      "part": "S2_0000_0050"
    },
    {
      "shot": "S2",
      "actor": "athlete",
      "term": "flight",
      "start": 4.48,
      "end": 4.88,
      "detail": "Feet unsupported: body fully extended with arms overhead at 4.58, then knees drawn forward and arms reaching ahead during descent at 4.78; first ground contact occurs at 4.88.",
      "attributes": {
        "feet": "both"
      },
      "id": "A005",
      "part": "S2_0000_0050"
    },
    {
      "shot": "S2",
      "actor": "athlete",
      "term": "landing_absorption",
      "start": 4.88,
      "end": 5.48,
      "detail": "Both feet contact at 4.88 and the athlete sinks into a deep squat by 5.08-5.28, loading the knees/hips to absorb the jump; arms drop low beside/behind the body during settling. Absorption ends as the recovery swing begins (~5.5); exact end is approximate between frames.",
      "attributes": {
        "knee_action": "flex",
        "feet": "both",
        "body_direction": "right"
      },
      "id": "A006",
      "part": "S2_0000_0050"
    },
    {
      "shot": "S2",
      "actor": "athlete",
      "term": "rise",
      "start": 5.58,
      "end": 6.88,
      "detail": "Stand-up after landing, not a second jump: from the deep squat the arms swing from low front (5.58) up to overhead (6.08-6.28) while still crouched, then knees and hips extend (6.58) to an upright arms-overhead stance by 6.78-6.88, which is then held to the end of the window. Arm swing and leg extension are sequential here, so they are logged within one rise action.",
      "attributes": {
